# Copy to .env.local for local development. Never commit .env.local.
# Nothing here is read yet - the bootstrap app has no features. Values land with the
# issues noted against each one.

# Fine-grained GitHub PAT, Contents: read-only. Read by the gap analysis engine (DX-28),
# which takes it as an argument rather than reading it at module scope, so the swap to
# per-user OAuth (DX-29) stays a one-line change.
# Because it is a shared credential, the deployment exposing it must stay gated behind
# Vercel Authentication until that swap lands.
GITHUB_API_TOKEN=
